{"id": "EUVD-2026-103984", "enisaUuid": "906acbf9-858e-3144-82a5-aa1c3a866ea5", "description": "Requesting `/{username}/-/repositories` for an individual user instead of an organization made the organization home handler dereference a nil organization and panic. The request needs no authentication and no special configuration. The server answered with an HTTP 500 error and logged a panic for each request; the fix returns 404 for individual users.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T18:56:41", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T20:14:33", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:L", "references": ["https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/security/advisories/GHSA-c3cr-qq9g-666c", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39839", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/pull/39847", "https://blog.gitea.com/release-of-28.2.0/", "https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/releases/tag/v28.2.0"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-105661"], "assigner": "Gitea", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d195f2c9-a85c-39f1-9139-f447b2c785d0", "product": {"name": "Gitea", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}, "product_version": "0 \u226428.1.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b6af2545-7599-3fb3-927e-58cfdeb8cc80", "vendor": {"name": "Gitea"}}], "isExploited": false}